&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a hands-on Software Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience directly leading an engineering team of at least 4 as an Engineering Manager and/or Engineering Lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience developing in Unreal, Unity, or another game engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience with game AI technologies (behavior trees, perception systems, etc.) and/or ML technologies (data science, machine learning, model training and inference, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing, reading, and reviewing C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in complex, large-scale game or engine codebases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills across disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Desired Qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing games for Xbox and PlayStation console platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Agile processes and continuous delivery&lt;/li&gt;
