&lt;li&gt;Mentorship. You help Rioters develop the tools and creative atmosphere to shine, but ultimately hold them accountable for making smart calls and delivering player value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the team&#39;s support rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
