&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to improve operating practices across teams and functions, increasing clarity, efficiency, and execution over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying AI and automation to streamline organizational workflows, accelerate decision-making, and increase operating leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
