&lt;li&gt;Agile certifications from Scrum Alliance, &lt;a href=&quot;http://scrum.org&quot;&gt;Scrum.org&lt;/a&gt;, PMI, or ICAgile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Atlassian Power User (Jira Product Discovery, Jira Space Administration, Jira Plans) or Atlassian certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
