&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical and architectural discussions, collaborating closely with the gameplay, backend, and core tech teams on scalable, cross-functional solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion engineering excellence, ensuring high standards in code quality, maintainability, and documentation, with a focus on clear, scalable, and sustainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate technical growth by mentoring engineers and sustaining a culture of collaboration and engineering excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own build engineering operations, including managing monitoring dashboards, Slack integrations, and improving code submission tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and track build metrics across build machines and development environments, and provide robust CI build support for both production deployment and internal developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
