&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on &lt;strong&gt;VALORANT’s Foundations Developer Experience &amp;amp; Workflows team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work directly on VAL’s development team, hand-in-hand with engineers, designers, artists, producers, and QA to build systems that enable them to move faster, work with greater confidence, and deliver amazing new experiences to players. To do this, you will design and evolve the platforms, tools, and workflows that power how VALORANT’s game developers create, iterate on, and validate content for both PC and console. Your work will span a diverse set of technical areas, adapting VALORANT’s development platform to meet needs wherever they emerge. This includes leveraging AI to accelerate development while establishing the appropriate guardrails for trust, quality, and reliability. This role will report to the Engineering Manager on the Foundations Developer Experience &amp;amp; Workflows team.&lt;/p&gt;
