&lt;p&gt;Riot Games Esports is setting the standard for the industry. We&#39;re looking for passionate individuals with a desire to build products that serve as a gateway to sports fandom. As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;in the Esports Platforms team, you will work with a team of producers, designers, and engineers to prototype, build, and own products to foster the Esports ecosystem. The web application this role owns, develops, and maintains sits at the heart of Riot Esports. You’ll shape the experience of professional and amateur competitive players, from tournament creation to the most exciting moments, such as getting into a match.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the development of Esports applications primarily using web technologies, while integrating with Esports and Game Services, providing technical guidance and hands-on code contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership within the team and adjacent teams to deliver high-quality, scalable, and reliable engineering solutions&lt;/li&gt;
