&lt;li&gt;Expertise with full software development life cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in one or more object oriented languages (i.e. Python, Go, Java, C++)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working with containers and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
