&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer, Mobile (C++ / Unreal)&lt;/strong&gt; on the &lt;strong&gt;Teamfight Tactics&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will work as part of a multidisciplinary team of engineers, artists, designers, QA, and other partners to build and support key areas of the game, with a particular focus on iOS and Android. You will primarily work in C++, while applying your native iOS and/or Android expertise to develop features, diagnose complex mobile-specific issues, and resolve engine and platform problems impacting the player experience. You will also help shape technical direction and engineering practices for mobile development across the team. You will report to an Engineering Manager on the CoreTech team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and maintain C++ systems and features supporting our game on mobile platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
