&lt;li&gt;Influence engineering best practices within and beyond the team, including technical design reviews, coding standards, code reviews, tooling, testing, and build and deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the performance, stability, reliability, and maintainability of the mobile game experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop sustainable solutions that improve the health of the codebase and leave systems better than you found them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technical and non-technical partners to understand requirements, evaluate tradeoffs, and deliver effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and help raise the technical capabilities of the broader team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the team&#39;s on-call and support rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
