&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Teamfight Tactics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in native iOS and/or Android development, including platform APIs, application lifecycle, build systems, debugging tools, and platform-specific performance considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing with Unreal Engine, including debugging or extending engine-level C++ systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience investigating and resolving issues at the boundary between Unreal Engine and native mobile platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
